{"id":"m4-088","m":4,"paper":"2017年山东省选调应届优秀高校毕业生到基层工作考试《行测》试卷（精选）","region":"选调","year":2017,"q":8,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2261755","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"在高架桥上用绳子测量高架桥的高度，把绳子对折垂到地面时尚余10米，把绳子三折垂到地面时尚余2米，则高架桥高度和绳长分别是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"13米和46米"},{"k":"B","t":"14米和48米"},{"k":"C","t":"15米和50米"},{"k":"D","t":"16米和52米"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：设绳长为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，则根据题意可列方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eb9e3eba894f4c51.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e540d5c1dfd439b3.png\" />，此时高架桥高度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-64ed9c566adf6715.png\" />。</p><p>方法二：根据题意，选项都为整数，可知绳子既可被2整除，也可被3整除，根据倍数特性，只有B选项符合条件。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2261756","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某农户家庭一年的总收入中，种植收入占四分之一，养殖收入占六分之一，已知其种植收入和养殖收入共计12000元，这个家庭一年的总收入是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"25500元"},{"k":"B","t":"26600元"},{"k":"C","t":"27700元"},{"k":"D","t":"28800元"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设这个家庭一年的总收入为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，则根据题意可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c8ac455b4d1e2530.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7bf1bcde53075d22.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2261757","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>一投资者用部分资金购买了股票和基金，一年后股票下跌了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f74801b8674b37ff.png\" />，基金升值了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9cf2b96c0c5f472e.png\" />，此时他将全部股票和基金卖出获利<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，则他购买股票和基金所投入的资金比为：</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1:4"},{"k":"B","t":"1:5"},{"k":"C","t":"1:6"},{"k":"D","t":"1:7"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：设投资者购买了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />元的股票，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-04add821e2712b37.png\" />元的基金。则根据题目条件有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-202ccdbb346cf4bc.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-403f10255bfb2aa8.png\" />。</p><p>方法二：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2e0a5bf3113b016e.png\" />，根据线段法，成本之比与利润率差之比成反比，有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-68592b6ed1408aa0.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-32ec518c992d2eae.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2261758","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某大型跨国连锁零售企业在世界8个城市共有76家超市，每个城市的超市数量都不相同。如果超市数量排名第四的城市有10家超市，那么超市数量排名最后的城市最多有几家超市？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3"},{"k":"B","t":"4"},{"k":"C","t":"5"},{"k":"D","t":"6"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>在世界共有76家超市，要使排名最后的城市超市数量最多，则应使其他城市的超市数量最少。设排名最后的城市最多有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />家超市， 如表所示，</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/171e91fe4e663b8.png\" /></p><p>则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5c44cbc527643557.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8e44769f7f1be37a.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-360ca8fb03270d95.png\" />。因排名最后的城市最多有6家超市。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2261759","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"今有水平相当的棋手甲和棋手乙参加某项大奖赛，奖金总额12000元。比赛规定下满五局获胜多者将赢得全部12000元奖金，已比赛三局，其中棋手甲两胜一负，现因故无法进行下面的比赛，试问如何分配奖金才算合理？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"棋手甲7000元，棋手乙5000元"},{"k":"B","t":"棋手甲8000元，棋手乙4000元"},{"k":"C","t":"棋手甲9000元，棋手乙3000元"},{"k":"D","t":"棋手甲10000元，棋手乙2000元"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，现已经比赛三局且需下满五局，甲已两胜一负，则只有当乙剩余两场全胜利时乙才能赢得比赛。因为二人水平相当，则乙赢得比赛的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9cf0117d77cbbd99.png\" />，甲赢得比赛的概率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1a977702587fee35.png\" />，故甲应分得奖金<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c081bc53f383f70.png\" />元，乙应分得奖金<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-19488d313fa3a0a9.png\" />元。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2261760","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某基地A年产水果7000吨，要运到400千米外的城市B，现基地A具有大型运输车和小型运输车各一辆，大型运输车的速度为80千米/小时，载重1000吨，小型运输车的速度为100千米/小时，载重500吨，那么，这批水果运到城市B的最短时间是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"47小时"},{"k":"B","t":"48小时"},{"k":"C","t":"44小时"},{"k":"D","t":"45小时"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>大型运输车的速度为80千米/小时，载重1000吨，则大型车运输到B地需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2dbeaf16acb496b2.png\" />小时，则运送一次往返需要10小时，运送1000吨。小型运输车的速度为100千米/小时，载重500吨，则小型车运输到B地需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-237eda733c8d131f.png\" />小时，往返运送一次需要8小时，运送500吨。因此40小时后，大型车运送<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5c31a5cbfa6520d6.png\" />吨，小型车运送<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-889da9ae120ebe8d.png\" />吨。此时还剩<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-555f504ffdc2ab38.png\" />吨，且大小型车都在A地，只需小型车再运送一次就可以了。因此时间为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bdfc429ee8675982.png\" />小时。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2261761","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"4名学生和2名教师排成一排照相，2名教师不在两端且要相邻的排法共有多少种？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"72"},{"k":"B","t":"108"},{"k":"C","t":"144"},{"k":"D","t":"288"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>2名老师要相邻，则考虑先捆绑，为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9fb37411cb820bdc.png\" /> 种情况；剩余4名学生和捆绑的老师进行排列，老师不在两头，则考虑插空法，为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7f70b886f0322556.png\" />种情况。则共有排法<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1c6604f339988769.png\" />种排法。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2261762","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某养鸡场出售每千克鸡蛋毛利0.8元时，每日能卖出1620千克，每千克毛利1.2元时，每日能卖出1000千克。如果两种情况的销售收入比为3：2，则每千克鸡蛋的成本是多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"4.2元"},{"k":"B","t":"4.4元"},{"k":"C","t":"4.6元"},{"k":"D","t":"4.8元"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设每千克鸡蛋的成本为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-25d768ac795d3bda.png\" />，则根据题意，可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c4d29904d4b4a730.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a7fd68e4474d5541.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"}]}]}